{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"\">\n  <state id=\"a\" initial=\" \">\n    <state id=\"a1\"><transition event=\"go\" target=\"a2\"/></state>\n    <state id=\"a2\"><transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/></state>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml006-empty-initial.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":2,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml006-empty-initial.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":70,"endColumn":71,"endLine":1,"startColumn":71,"startLine":1},"insertedContent":{"text":"a"}}]}],"description":{"text":"enter `a`, the first child state"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml006-empty-initial.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":72,"endLine":1,"startColumn":62,"startLine":1}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`initial` on `<scxml>` names no state\n\n**Note:** an `initial` attribute lists the states entered first; an empty list enters nothing, so the compiler rejects it (omit the attribute to enter the first child state)\n\n**Help:** name the initial state, or remove `initial` to enter the first child state in document order\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.2 <scxml>","text":"`initial` on `<scxml>` names no state"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":71,"start":61},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML006"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml006-empty-initial.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":1,"byteOffset":98,"endColumn":27,"endLine":2,"startColumn":26,"startLine":2},"insertedContent":{"text":"a1"}}]}],"description":{"t